  "content": "# Revised SOP Checklist\n\n## Overview Changes\n- [ ] Security measures updated to include mandatory MFA (request.txt) and daily vulnerability scanning (audit_findings.txt)\n- [ ] Added DLP solution requirements from policy.txt\n- [ ] Standardized incident response process with clear roles per request.txt\n- [ ] Backup procedures now require daily incremental backups (audit_findings.txt recommendation)\n\n## Key Updates\n### Security Enhancements\n1. **Mandatory Multi-Factor Authentication** implementation deadline: 2023-12-01 (request.txt)\n   - *Verification required*: IT team must document completion date and method\n2. Vulnerability scanning frequency increased to daily using enhanced tools (audit_findings.txt finding #47)\n   - *Validation criteria*: Scan logs stored in designated folder with verification dates marked\n3. Data encryption standard updated to AES-256 compliance per policy requirements\n   - *Implementation guide*: Include key rotation schedule and storage procedures\n\n### Operational Procedures\n1. Incident response process now includes:\n   - Clear roles defined in request.txt (Incident Commander, Technical Lead)\n   - Standardized communication protocols from audit recommendations\n   - Post-incident review template attached as Appendix B\n2. Backup procedures updated to daily incremental with retention policy of 30 days for critical systems (audit_findings.txt finding #19)"
}
